  "fullDescription": "Art nouveau fans and anyone drawn to vintage botanical illustration with decorative flair will love the richness of this print. It shows a fig branch with large lobed dark green leaves and plump purple-brown figs in a realistic detailed style, set within an ornate art nouveau frame with gold and pink floral scrollwork and cream background.\n\nThis print brings a sophisticated touch to a dining room, living room, or study. It works well as a large framed print, on fine art stationery, as a gift for fig or garden lovers, and in any space with vintage or European inspired decor.\n\nWhat’s Included\n– SVG file – fully scalable, ideal for cutting machines and design software\n– PNG file – high-resolution with transparent background, ready for sublimation and printing\n\nHow It Works\nThis is an instant digital download. Once your purchase is complete, your files are available immediately — no waiting, no shipping. Just download, open, and create!\n\nImportant Notes\n– Digital file only — no physical item will be mailed\n– SVG files work with Cricut Design Space, Silhouette Studio, Adobe Illustrator, Inkscape, and similar programs\n– PNG files can be used in most graphic design and sublimation software\n– Colors may vary slightly depending on your screen and printer setup",
